WEBVTT

00:47.005 --> 00:48.166
The enemy has been destroyed.

00:48.685 --> 00:50.972
A full battalion from an enemy ship
has landed in Fukuoka.

00:52.365 --> 00:55.255
Order our standard regiment
in Kasuga to retreat!

00:57.965 --> 00:59.046
Hurry! Withdraw!

00:59.205 --> 00:59.933
Withdraw! !

01:28.925 --> 01:31.246
They have unleashed
their nation's new military weapon...!

01:36.685 --> 01:37.811
All signs of military destroyed.

01:38.405 --> 01:40.089
"She" is returning.

02:14.565 --> 02:15.612
Lt. Colonel Mizuki.

02:16.085 --> 02:17.530
I'm very glad you're back.

02:18.645 --> 02:19.487
Where is the Director?

02:19.565 --> 02:21.215
He's in the maintenance room.

02:39.485 --> 02:42.568
Director, the fall of Kyushu is
only a matter of time now.

02:43.085 --> 02:45.247
Lt. Colonel Mizuki,
do you need any repairs?

02:45.925 --> 02:46.653
Oh...your arm.

02:47.045 --> 02:48.729
You'll have to make due
with a spare.

02:50.205 --> 02:50.854
What's that?

02:51.565 --> 02:54.375
Lt. Colonel, you must have heard
the rumors, too.

02:55.085 --> 02:57.087
About our army's ultimate weapon.

02:59.405 --> 03:02.614
We can no longer turn back.

03:41.085 --> 03:42.211
<i>Shuji...</i>

03:42.805 --> 03:43.647
<i>Shuji...</i>

04:14.805 --> 04:16.773
<i>Shuji... How are you?</i>

04:18.165 --> 04:22.489
<i>Are you being lazy or relaxing
because it's our summer vacation?</i>

04:24.125 --> 04:27.254
<i>You should be busy with
summer classes this time of day...</i>

04:28.165 --> 04:28.814
<i>Oh... I forgot...</i>

04:29.125 --> 04:31.651
<i>You're in Sapporo today
with Atsushi and the others...</i>

04:32.565 --> 04:38.015
<i>I'm sorry, Shuji.
I know I was going to go with you...</i>

04:38.765 --> 04:42.565
<i>I! was supposed to be
our very first date...</i>

04:43.325 --> 04:44.133
<i>I'm sorry...</i>

04:47.325 --> 04:50.772
Right now, Chise still can't
accept herself as a weapon...

04:51.205 --> 04:53.173
She is unable to control her will.

04:54.405 --> 04:57.568
Chise's thoughts are sure to have reached
Lt. Colonel Misuki by now...

04:58.325 --> 05:00.168
She will be able to control
Chise's actions.

05:01.885 --> 05:06.288
<i>I wanted to walk the streets
of Sapporo with you.</i>

05:06.405 --> 05:08.089
Here you are, Lt. Colonel.

05:09.045 --> 05:10.285
<i>And I'd do
lots and lots of shopping...</i>

05:10.405 --> 05:11.895
Who is she in civilian life?

05:12.685 --> 05:15.165
She's a high school senior
in Hokkaido.

05:16.245 --> 05:17.167
Who's Shuji?

05:17.925 --> 05:19.529
One of her classmates.

05:19.965 --> 05:21.490
They're dating.

05:22.565 --> 05:27.605
<i>Shuji, I have a big secret
I've been keeping from you.</i>

05:31.285 --> 05:34.732
So you really can hear
her thoughts, Lt. Colonel?

05:35.765 --> 05:39.292
<i>They've made me into
the ultimate weapon...</i>

05:40.125 --> 05:40.648
<i>NO!!!</i>

05:43.445 --> 05:45.891
I long to see you...Shuji...

05:50.965 --> 05:53.445
Does Command Headquarters really
intend to use this girl as a weapon?

05:55.965 --> 05:57.854
What is she capable of?

05:58.125 --> 05:59.092
She's still a child!

05:59.365 --> 06:01.288
Yes, but in training exercises
the other day...

06:01.405 --> 06:04.454
she far exceeded
the expectations of Headquarters...

06:08.445 --> 06:09.492
Lt. Colonel Mizuki?

06:09.965 --> 06:11.490
Is that the face of a fighter'?

06:12.565 --> 06:15.728
I refuse to acknowledge her
as a soldier!!

06:16.405 --> 06:17.930
<i>No!! They're attacking Sapporo...</i>

06:31.685 --> 06:33.653
How long will it take Chise
to get to Sapporo?

06:34.085 --> 06:34.847
Five minutes, sir.

06:35.365 --> 06:35.888
Only five minutes?

06:38.125 --> 06:40.696
Director, may I please have
the order to scramble?

06:42.845 --> 06:43.289
Director!

06:44.085 --> 06:45.928
Chise is already on her way there.

06:46.645 --> 06:48.932
Impossible... She can't protect
the city by herself.

06:49.405 --> 06:52.534
Neither can you, Lt. Colonel,
with your arm that way.

06:53.085 --> 06:55.167
But I must fight with her.

06:55.525 --> 06:58.449
There's only so much
we can depend on you for.

06:59.165 --> 07:01.008
We must leave this to Chise.

07:01.605 --> 07:04.051
If she cannot protect the city...

07:04.125 --> 07:09.052
It will mean that we are lost.
That we have no future as a nation.

07:12.605 --> 07:14.255
Enemy planes are headed south
towards northern Sapporo.

07:14.365 --> 07:15.696
We can't get a count
on how many.

07:17.085 --> 07:18.325
The attack has begun.

07:19.405 --> 07:22.887
A large part of northern Sapporo is
in flames from the enemy attack.

07:23.165 --> 07:24.405
And they are now spreading
to the south.

07:25.685 --> 07:28.131
One minute until reinforcements
from Misawa arrive.

07:29.285 --> 07:32.812
Doesn't he have a wife and
daughter in Sapporo?

07:34.645 --> 07:36.454
<i>Huh? What's going on?</i>

07:37.885 --> 07:40.126
<i>That's right! Shuji's in danger!</i>

07:41.045 --> 07:43.889
<i>It's in Sapporo! I was supposed
to be there with Shuji...</i>

07:44.005 --> 07:44.972
<i>I need to hurry!</i>

07:48.285 --> 07:51.926
<i>Oh. I'd hate to have Shuji
see me like this...</i>

07:54.445 --> 07:55.890
One F-2 is down.

07:56.245 --> 07:58.725
We don't know
if the pilot survived.

07:59.685 --> 08:00.288
It's Chisel

08:00.725 --> 08:02.170
Director! It's Chisel

08:02.525 --> 08:03.526
Chise made it in time!

08:05.085 --> 08:05.972
<i>What do I do?</i>

08:06.645 --> 08:08.170
<i>There are so many enemy planes.</i>

08:09.885 --> 08:11.933
<i>I mus! hurry
and do something...</i>

08:15.525 --> 08:17.846
<i>I can hear Shuji's voice.</i>

08:18.765 --> 08:20.767
<i>I'm so glad that he's alive.</i>

08:21.365 --> 08:24.016
<i>Somewhere in Sapporo, Shuji lives!!</i>

08:25.125 --> 08:26.251
<i>Now, I must do my best!</i>

08:27.605 --> 08:28.572
Lt. Colonel Mizuki...

08:28.805 --> 08:31.012
What is Chise's level of
consciousness at this time?

08:31.565 --> 08:33.408
Does she realize what she is doing?

08:34.045 --> 08:35.535
No. She has no idea.

08:36.125 --> 08:37.695
<i>Te“ me what she is thinking.</i>

08:38.645 --> 08:40.807
You don't need to know that...

08:47.005 --> 08:48.006
<i>Chise is down“.!</i>

08:49.605 --> 08:50.492
She is alive.

08:50.925 --> 08:53.246
So it will be impossible to control
her completely, after all.

08:54.525 --> 08:57.574
Her fighting power is now
at only 30%.

08:58.165 --> 08:59.690
The enemy planes are retreating!

09:04.085 --> 09:05.928
<i>I'm sorry, Shuji...</i>

09:06.845 --> 09:09.769
<i>This is what I've become...</i>

09:16.285 --> 09:17.127
<i>Shuji...</i>

09:19.125 --> 09:20.456
<i>Squadron Leader!</i>

09:20.685 --> 09:21.891
<i>Help! g!</i>

09:22.005 --> 09:23.416
<i>I don'! wanna die!</i>

09:24.805 --> 09:25.692
<i>Squadron Leader!</i>

09:25.765 --> 09:26.687
<i>M-My leg...!</i>

09:58.725 --> 10:00.489
Capt. Mizuki, I'm corning in.

10:05.885 --> 10:07.330
Are you okay, Captain?

10:07.805 --> 10:10.331
My battalion...
Where are my men?

10:11.325 --> 10:13.168
I'm sorry, Captain.
They didn't make it.

10:14.045 --> 10:16.173
You are the only survivor.

10:18.445 --> 10:23.133
Captain, this is Director Minamoto
of Special Missions

10:23.245 --> 10:25.725
and Dr. Wada from the Military
Science Research Laboratory.

10:28.725 --> 10:31.171
What can we do for you, Captain?

10:32.325 --> 10:34.054
Send me back
onto the battlefield.

10:34.765 --> 10:36.369
That would be impossible
in your condition.

10:36.965 --> 10:40.014
I'm a soldier.
I will fight on one leg if I have to.

10:42.205 --> 10:43.889
Please, Director. . .7

10:44.405 --> 10:47.329
I can't be the only one that lives.

10:52.325 --> 10:53.247
Please!

10:54.205 --> 10:57.129
There might be a way for you
to return to the battlefield.

10:57.565 --> 10:59.772
But it is still
in its experimental stage.

11:00.245 --> 11:03.215
I can't even begin to predict
what it will do to your body.

11:03.765 --> 11:05.290
That doesn't matter.

11:21.805 --> 11:22.727
Where are you going?

11:26.685 --> 11:27.493
G-Good Morning.

11:28.485 --> 11:31.853
What are you doing in that uniform?

11:33.845 --> 11:34.528
<i>I'm sorry...</i>

11:35.365 --> 11:40.212
But I was told that I could
go to school after...

11:40.645 --> 11:44.650
I don't know who told you that or
how you convinced them to let you go.

11:45.125 --> 11:47.526
But I am still your superior officer...

11:47.925 --> 11:50.451
I will not allow
such a ridiculous promise.

11:51.085 --> 11:52.132
You will stay here!

11:52.885 --> 11:54.808
But I did all my work here...

11:55.325 --> 11:56.326
Work?

11:57.245 --> 11:58.610
Yes. So I thought
I could go back...

11:58.725 --> 11:59.886
Don't be so foolish.

12:00.885 --> 12:03.365
Don't you understand
your position here?

12:04.285 --> 12:05.855
We are no longer humans.

12:06.445 --> 12:09.415
We are weapons created to protect
this nation and it's future.

12:11.885 --> 12:14.491
I think she should be
allowed to go.

12:15.765 --> 12:17.574
The Director has already
approved it.

12:18.045 --> 12:19.854
Please, let her go.

12:21.565 --> 12:22.487
<i>I'm sorry...</i>

12:23.605 --> 12:26.814
She doesn't have the will
to protect the country.

12:26.925 --> 12:28.768
Let alone fight...

12:29.285 --> 12:31.447
We've forced her into this.

12:31.885 --> 12:33.535
Please forgive her
and let her go.

12:39.485 --> 12:41.613
<i>Shuji! Good morning.</i>

12:42.325 --> 12:44.009
<i>It's very hot today, isn't it?</i>

13:02.485 --> 13:04.010
Lt. Tetsu, they're coming.

13:04.565 --> 13:06.294
This is it.
They have come.

13:08.125 --> 13:08.808
So listen up!

13:09.005 --> 13:10.848
No one will die today.
That's an order.

13:10.965 --> 13:11.852
You'll make it out alive.

13:19.765 --> 13:21.767
Central battalion,
we have an SOS from...

13:21.885 --> 13:23.091
the second Composite Forces.

13:23.605 --> 13:25.209
They're requesting help from
Special Missions.

13:26.365 --> 13:27.014
Where's Chise?

13:27.405 --> 13:28.691
We can't get ahold of her.

13:29.005 --> 13:32.407
She's in gym class and
has turned her pager off.

13:32.525 --> 13:35.256
What the hell is she doing
in gym class, at a time like this?!

13:35.365 --> 13:36.491
Bring her here
immediately!

13:36.605 --> 13:36.969
Yessir!

13:38.365 --> 13:40.367
<i>Director, send me instead oi her.</i>

13:41.085 --> 13:43.292
She doesn't have the will to fight.

13:43.965 --> 13:47.686
If the future of the military depends
on her will to fight,

13:48.005 --> 13:50.246
we may as well surrender now.

13:50.645 --> 13:51.328
Silence, Lt. Colonel!

13:51.645 --> 13:53.090
Please. Give me the order.

14:02.445 --> 14:04.015
You are sure about this girl?

14:04.125 --> 14:05.934
She volunteered for this.

14:07.205 --> 14:10.129
It's only a matter of time
before Kochi falls.

14:11.005 --> 14:14.976
There is no need to reveal
our ultimate weapon to the enemy,

14:15.085 --> 14:17.133
when the final battle
is still at hand.

14:20.405 --> 14:21.008
Get downy!

14:23.925 --> 14:25.370
Dammit. Not again.

14:25.525 --> 14:28.096
I am not losing my men again.

14:37.205 --> 14:38.013
<i>Dammit...</i>

14:39.045 --> 14:40.490
It may be it...

14:52.405 --> 14:53.213
<i>Tetsu!</i>

15:04.365 --> 15:07.847
Is that? Could that be
the new weapon we heard about?

15:15.525 --> 15:16.174
Retreat!

15:16.445 --> 15:18.209
Get out! Save yourselves!!

15:18.725 --> 15:19.487
<i>Captain Tetsu!</i>

15:19.885 --> 15:21.808
<i>Your wife is waiting for you
in Hokkaido.</i>

15:22.445 --> 15:24.209
<i>You can't die in a place like this.</i>

15:28.965 --> 15:31.366
Squadron Leader, have you ever
been in love?

15:32.445 --> 15:33.048
Nope.

15:34.565 --> 15:35.691
Such a waste.

15:36.325 --> 15:40.887
If I had met you earlier,
I probably would have fallen for you...

15:42.205 --> 15:43.809
Err... I mean...

15:44.085 --> 15:46.770
Look, every man in Mizuki Squadron
is in love with you.

15:47.125 --> 15:49.890
And we have sworn
to protect you always.

15:50.685 --> 15:52.733
We will survive this together,
I promise.

15:54.445 --> 15:57.289
But you really are a fool, you know.

15:58.805 --> 16:01.809
You graduated from the military Academy
at the top of your class...

16:02.325 --> 16:05.090
You didn't have to come here and
put yourself in danger again...

16:05.925 --> 16:10.408
But if I hadn't come, I would never
have met such brave soldiers. Like you.

16:10.605 --> 16:11.766
Brave. Huh?

16:12.565 --> 16:17.014
Lt. Tetsu, no one is
going to die on my watch.

16:22.445 --> 16:23.332
Everyone! Let's go!

16:23.445 --> 16:25.174
We're the invincible men
of the Mizuki Squadron!

16:25.445 --> 16:27.209
<i>Let's show 'em what we're made of!</i>

16:37.845 --> 16:39.574
The combined forces have
begun their withdrawal.

16:40.965 --> 16:43.332
We were able to stand
our ground today.

16:43.965 --> 16:46.286
But after all, she is not...

16:46.765 --> 16:50.815
It was ultimately an experiment
to create Chise.

16:51.605 --> 16:53.926
And that mission has been fulfilled.

17:00.245 --> 17:02.168
Is the Lt. Colonel really...?

17:02.485 --> 17:06.695
Yes. Unfortunately, her growth
as a weapon has stopped.

17:07.565 --> 17:10.045
If she sustains the same level
of damage again,

17:10.165 --> 17:12.452
she probably will not recover.

17:30.885 --> 17:31.772
Good morning.

17:31.845 --> 17:33.370
You've been asleep for three days.

17:33.925 --> 17:34.687
Three days?

17:35.685 --> 17:37.813
<i>No. No. Don'! shoot! Please!</i>

17:37.885 --> 17:39.250
<i>Stay away from me!</i>

17:41.645 --> 17:42.976
ls something wrong?

17:43.645 --> 17:44.453
Where's Chise?

17:44.885 --> 17:45.886
Tell me where Chise is!

17:46.725 --> 17:47.851
On the battlefield...

17:48.365 --> 17:49.366
ls there a problem?

18:31.645 --> 18:32.373
<i>I'm sorry...</i>

18:33.205 --> 18:39.167
I wish I could understand you.
To talk to you...

18:56.325 --> 18:57.929
NO! Don't shoot!

18:59.845 --> 19:00.528
Please! !

19:11.245 --> 19:12.292
Chise is returning to base.

19:18.365 --> 19:21.687
<i>I am a demon... I am a monster...</i>

19:22.565 --> 19:24.249
<i>I am death...</i>

19:33.685 --> 19:35.608
I must kill before I'm killed...

19:35.925 --> 19:37.768
I must kill before I'm killed.

19:38.085 --> 19:39.814
I must kill before I'm killed.

19:40.805 --> 19:42.409
I must kill before I'm killed.

19:43.085 --> 19:44.655
I must kill before I'm killed...

19:56.205 --> 19:58.856
Why do we have to
involve Chise in this war?

19:58.925 --> 20:02.293
When she has absolutely
no sense of what it is to be a soldier...

20:02.405 --> 20:04.976
When all her experiences
are as an ordinary civilian...

20:06.565 --> 20:10.411
Director, it is impossible for her
to fight like a soldier.

20:11.285 --> 20:13.686
We have no other weapon
to match her power.

20:14.005 --> 20:16.167
That may be, but she suffers.

20:16.845 --> 20:19.496
Are you saying that you are willing
to take Chise's place...

20:19.605 --> 20:20.766
To save us from this?

20:23.485 --> 20:26.409
You do not have the power
that she does.

20:27.285 --> 20:30.767
<i>Then improve me.
Make me stronger.</i>

20:31.165 --> 20:33.406
Increase my fighting power!

20:33.805 --> 20:40.609
I will endure the pain and suffering
because I have the will to fight.

20:41.725 --> 20:44.171
That we cannot do, Lt. Colonel Mizuki...

20:44.405 --> 20:47.329
You have reached your limit
as a weapon.

20:47.685 --> 20:50.291
Chise, however, has much
more potential yet.

20:50.605 --> 20:53.495
Her fighting power will grow stronger.

20:56.085 --> 20:58.213
You are telling me
I am no longer necessary?

20:58.765 --> 21:01.006
You still have your
superior intelligence.

21:01.725 --> 21:06.128
Will my superior intelligence help
end this wan'?

21:08.125 --> 21:11.095
Why is it that those who want
to fight aren't allowed to...

21:11.245 --> 21:14.772
while those who don't want to fight
are forced to?

21:15.285 --> 21:17.333
Chise's will cannot be considered.

21:17.445 --> 21:19.732
She's a superior weapon.
She will fight.

21:20.285 --> 21:21.730
She was the only one...

21:23.685 --> 21:27.087
Her body was the only one
we found that would adapt.

21:27.605 --> 21:31.690
It was just what happened...

21:33.005 --> 21:34.245
It wasn't you.

21:34.845 --> 21:37.576
If we could have found another,
we would have...

21:37.925 --> 21:39.165
However, at that time, well...

21:39.525 --> 21:41.732
Chise was the only one.

21:44.365 --> 21:46.606
It couldn't be helped.

21:56.685 --> 21:59.894
<i>I am a demon... I am a monster...</i>

22:01.445 --> 22:03.891
<i>You have reached your limit
as a weapon.</i>

22:05.285 --> 22:07.526
<i>She's a superior weapon.
She will fight.</i>

22:08.525 --> 22:10.334
<i>It couldn't be helped.</i>

22:45.445 --> 22:46.606
Chise's still on the run.

22:49.685 --> 22:50.686
She's run away?

22:51.085 --> 22:53.611
Yes, on a bike. With that boy.

22:53.965 --> 22:55.967
Chise has fired her missiles
on the satellite.

22:57.685 --> 22:58.846
They will strike soon.

23:00.565 --> 23:01.976
The satellite is down.

23:02.245 --> 23:03.735
Get another satellite
into position now!

23:03.965 --> 23:06.775
The combined forces have begun
their assault on Osaka.

23:07.205 --> 23:07.888
Osaka?

23:08.085 --> 23:09.246
We must bring Chise back now.

23:10.605 --> 23:12.050
She is too dangerous right now.

23:12.405 --> 23:14.214
She is too unpredictable.

23:14.725 --> 23:17.046
We've made contact with
Mr. Kawahara in Chise's town.

23:17.325 --> 23:17.894
Let me speak to him!

23:19.645 --> 23:21.488
Where is Chise? Where is she?

23:21.925 --> 23:23.973
<i>We've lost sigh! of her.
I'm very sorry.</i>

23:24.605 --> 23:27.336
<i>We're searching in the area
where she was last</i> seen.

23:31.045 --> 23:32.649
<i>I must do it before they find me.</i>

23:33.685 --> 23:34.732
We have visual contact.

23:35.445 --> 23:36.526
Call off the search!

23:36.765 --> 23:38.051
Get way from there now!!

23:38.245 --> 23:39.053
<i>But...</i>

23:39.605 --> 23:40.492
Don't you get it?

23:40.645 --> 23:42.215
Right now, she is just a weapon.

23:42.445 --> 23:44.447
She's a weapon who doesn't care
whose side you're on.

23:45.005 --> 23:45.847
<i>I understand.</i>

23:46.645 --> 23:47.487
<i>We will evacuate.</i>

23:49.885 --> 23:51.296
I'm going to see Chise.

23:58.085 --> 23:59.052
<i>I'm going away...</i>

23:59.485 --> 24:01.169
<i>I'm going to a place where
they will never find me...</i>

24:01.285 --> 24:02.696
<i>To live forever with Shuji!</i>

24:07.085 --> 24:09.247
Osaka is under siege.

24:09.885 --> 24:11.011
Please. Go save them.

24:11.645 --> 24:13.727
No. Please!

24:14.525 --> 24:16.289
<i>Leave me alone.
Let me go.</i>

24:16.445 --> 24:18.686
What do you think you're doing?

24:20.245 --> 24:22.691
Right now, countless soldiers
are dying on the battlefield...

24:22.845 --> 24:25.325
And countless civilians are
being killed by the enemy.

24:25.925 --> 24:27.051
Why me?

24:27.765 --> 24:29.494
Why Only me?

24:31.965 --> 24:33.455
If you want them saved so badly,

24:33.565 --> 24:35.408
why don't you go and
save them yourself, Lt. Colonel?

24:35.685 --> 24:36.572
You're just like me...

24:36.685 --> 24:40.132
You think I would rely on
you if I didn't have to?

24:41.125 --> 24:41.967
I'm no longer...

24:43.005 --> 24:45.895
I'm no longer
an effective weapon...

24:46.005 --> 24:48.406
My power is nothing
compared to yours...

24:48.765 --> 24:51.814
You are the only one who can
save us from this war.

24:52.685 --> 24:54.653
But I want to be with Shuji and...

24:54.965 --> 24:58.287
I cannot allow you to let
tens of thousands of people die.

24:58.365 --> 25:00.254
Just so you can be
with your boyfriend.

25:00.325 --> 25:04.296
Then kill me and take my powers.

25:04.405 --> 25:07.329
If killing you would transfer
your powers to me...

25:07.765 --> 25:10.291
I wouldn't hesitate for a second.

25:14.605 --> 25:17.176
This is not an order, Chise.
It's a plea.

25:17.725 --> 25:19.966
Please fight for us.

25:21.565 --> 25:23.806
Otherwise, they will soon
be here, too.

25:26.805 --> 25:27.966
Okay. I understand.

25:30.005 --> 25:32.326
<i>I'm sorry...</i>

25:36.365 --> 25:38.288
Today's her birthday?

25:38.405 --> 25:41.614
Yeah, I guess.
I hope things are OK in Sumiyoshi.

25:44.005 --> 25:44.608
What the--?

25:44.925 --> 25:46.290
We're picking up
an enemy transmission.

25:48.445 --> 25:48.934
God?

25:57.485 --> 25:58.646
Good work.

26:08.085 --> 26:08.893
Shuji...

26:20.605 --> 26:21.652
What is that?

26:22.045 --> 26:25.208
The guy who drew it said
it was some kind of Goddess.

26:25.845 --> 26:27.290
<i>“Save me Chise“</i>

26:27.405 --> 26:28.486
Is she a guardian deity?

26:28.605 --> 26:29.686
She's very cute.

26:31.445 --> 26:33.015
Did she look like that?

26:34.925 --> 26:35.733
Not a chance.

26:38.965 --> 26:41.445
We have detected an enemy squadron
heading north near Ogasawara.

26:41.965 --> 26:44.047
Order the evacuation
of the metro region. Now.

26:44.245 --> 26:44.689
Yessir!

26:45.085 --> 26:48.168
The remaining troops from Osaka
and Chubu have joined up

26:48.285 --> 26:50.174
and are heading toward
the Kanto region.

26:52.405 --> 26:54.089
Is Chise capable
of launching an attack?

26:54.805 --> 26:56.455
She's still in maintenance.

26:57.165 --> 27:00.453
It's only been one day.
She's not back to 100% yet.

27:00.845 --> 27:02.847
Put a rush on her recovery.
We need to launch her.

27:02.965 --> 27:03.375
Yessir!
